        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Game Overview</strong><br><i>ARTIST SLAYER / RUSH</i> is a stylish VR action game where players take on the role of the <strong>SLAYER</strong>, <strong>SLASH</strong> a horde of enemies(<strong>RUSH</strong>) with speed and precision. Wielding a variety of weapons such as swords and guns, you’ll unleash fast-paced, visceral combat that feels like channeling your inner rage.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Key Features</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A technical combat style that blends slashing melee and ranged gunplay</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Intuitive controls and immersive action unique to VR</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Thrilling stages filled with relentless enemy hordes</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Grotesque, gory expressions that awaken your inner demon</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Intense rock and metal soundtrack combined with realistic sound effects</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Concept art exhibition inside the game</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Supported:Meta Quest 2 / Quest 3 via Oculus/Meta Quest Link, Rift S</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Playable when Oculus/Meta Quest Link is set as the PC’s OpenXR Runtime. SteamVR runtime is not fully supported yet.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3971820/extras/8af35d87c0c385b1d0a421098305b439.avif?t=1760573597\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3971820/extras_big/8af35d87c0c385b1d0a421098305b439.webp?t=1760573597 width=1560 height=1308 /></span></p>",
